@startuml
title Stage 0.5 Extension Points toward Stage 1 and Stage 2

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Stage 0.5" {
  component Decode05 as "DecodeNode (synthetic)"
  component Detect05 as "DummyDetectionNode"
  component Output05 as "OutputNode"
  component Meta05 as "ChannelRuntimeMetaStore"
}

package "Stage 1" {
  component Input1 as "InputSourceNode"
  component Decode1 as "DecodeNode (real)"
  component Pre1 as "PreprocessNode"
  component Infer1 as "InferAdaptor ORT"
  component Post1 as "PostprocessNode"
  component Output1 as "OutputNode"
}

package "Stage 2" {
  component Pre2 as "GPU Preprocess"
  component Infer2 as "InferAdaptor TRT"
  component Cuda2 as "CUDA Context Pool"
  component Output2 as "OutputNode"
}

Decode05 --> Detect05
Detect05 --> Output05
Detect05 --> Meta05
Output05 --> Meta05

Input1 --> Decode1
Decode1 --> Pre1
Pre1 --> Infer1
Infer1 --> Post1
Post1 --> Output1

Pre1 --> Meta05
Post1 --> Meta05

Pre2 --> Infer2
Infer2 --> Output2
Cuda2 --> Infer2

note right of Meta05
Global runtime metadata shared across nodes.
Stage 0.5 establishes the contract only.
end note

note bottom of Input1
Stage 1 begins when a real input source
is connected to the pipeline.
end note

note bottom of Infer2
Stage 2 focuses on GPU residency,
TensorRT, and CUDA execution control.
end note

@enduml
